    {
      "id": "6147ebb8-d4f0-4382-ba3a-d33923c0ac64",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        224,
        -608
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 800,
        "height": 96,
        "content": "FF&E Product Data Extraction\nConverts supplier product page URLs into structured FF&E records in Google Sheets. The workflow validates the request, retrieves product content, structures key attributes with Google Gemini, updates the correct record using Automation ID, and handles inaccessible supplier pages through a dedicated failure path."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b1e49c15-bc66-42ad-8ec2-4125f95c9b2f",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -416,
        -448
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#0C2436",
        "width": 512,
        "height": 496,
        "content": "Receive & Validate the Product Request\n\nThe workflow receives a POST request containing:\n- productUrl\n- category\n- automationId\n- sheetName\n- row\nAutomation ID is the unique record key used to return extracted data to the correct Google Sheets row. The product URL is validated before any external request is made."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "307469f0-644a-4e4e-b5b8-08b9ae176e2d",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        176,
        -448
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#39313A",
        "width": 384,
        "height": 496,
        "content": "Retrieve the Supplier Page\n\nThe product page is requested over HTTP and checked before extraction begins.\nIf usable content is returned, the workflow continues to HTML extraction.\nIf the page is blocked, unavailable, or empty, the workflow updates the matching record with:\nFailed Page fetch error\nSome supplier sites may require a dedicated scraping service because of anti-bot protection or client-side rendering."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "50c8817f-5861-4649-a698-3662922ac160",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        608,
        -448
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#000000",
        "width": 496,
        "height": 496,
        "content": "Extract & Structure FF&E Data\n\nThe HTML step removes scripts, styles, and non content elements while extracting visible product information and the primary og:image URL when available.\nGoogle Gemini structures the page content into:\n- SKU / product code\n- Finish / colour\n- Supplier / manufacturer\n- Vendor description\n- Product notes\nUnsupported values are left empty rather than fabricated."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "14a08bba-e66a-4491-b47e-c4649b1426a9",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1184,
        -448
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#272B28",
        "width": 448,
        "height": 496,
        "content": "Assemble & Update the FF&E Schedule\n\nThe extracted data is combined with the original product URL, category, image URL, and Automation ID.\nGoogle Sheets is updated by matching Automation ID, ensuring the correct FF&E record is modified.\nSuccessful records are marked Completed.\nRequired columns:\nImage | Category | SKU | Finish/Colour | Supplier | Vendor Description | Notes | Product Website | Location | Automation ID | Status\nLocation is intentionally left unchanged for project-specific use."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9930e4ed-9286-438a-926f-b81fb49f14a9",
